WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,240
He has the same bloodline as that witch phoenix.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,240
Can control willow trees

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,300
What is his name Liulan?

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,690
I remember

5
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,010
do me a favor

6
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:16,280
Someone will spread the news that you are dead

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:19,380
But I can’t hide it from everyone

8
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,980
Just screen out the fools

9
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,870
Where is the third elder?

10
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,870
I still have something to ask him

11
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:36,760
It should be the second brother in the garden

12
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:37,760
don't be too sad

13
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:41,010
This is what we discussed

14
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,010
Big brother him

15
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,010
It's also voluntary

16
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:48,500
The Liu family still needs me

17
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,500
no matter what

18
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,500
I will live

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,500
If one day in the future I disappear

20
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:56,890
That would be a relief

21
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:58,890
The second brother Hongfu Qitian

22
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:00,920
Will live a long life

23
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:05,420
Make good preparations for your elder brother’s funeral later.

24
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:10,420
Then it’s time for the Liu family to grow stronger. It’s the second brother.
